WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.836
Long words are built from smaller parts.

2
00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:11.273
Like building blocks!

3
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:18.471
un + happi + ness. Prefix, root, suffix.

4
00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:22.161
The ROOT is the main word: happy.

5
00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:27.313
A PREFIX goes at the front. A SUFFIX goes at the end.

6
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.622
One root can make a whole family of words.

7
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.711
helpful, helpless, unhelpful, helper.

8
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.115
Spot the root and the spelling gets easier!

9
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.701
Prefixes change the meaning of a word.

10
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.579
un- means not. re- means again.

11
00:00:56.567 --> 00:01:00.282
Prefix rule: just add it. Never change the root.

12
00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:12.325
mis + spell equals misspell. That's why it has two s's!

13
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.761
Suffixes change how a word is used.

14
00:01:20.733 --> 00:01:23.844
-ful means full of. -less means without.

15
00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:28.084
But suffixes can change the spelling. Three rules!

16
00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:31.739
Rule 1: drop the e.

17
00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:41.012
The suffix starts with a vowel, so the e goes.

18
00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:48.144
-ful starts with a consonant, so keep the e.

19
00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:52.223
Rule 2: change y to i.

20
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.954
After a consonant, y changes to i.

21
00:02:07.933 --> 00:02:10.487
Watch out: keep the y before -ing.

22
00:02:12.467 --> 00:02:14.696
Rule 3: double the last letter.

23
00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:23.457
Short vowel, one consonant at the end? Double it.

24
00:02:28.233 --> 00:02:30.137
run + ing equals running.

25
00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:36.455
One letter makes a different word!

26
00:02:38.433 --> 00:02:41.359
Your turn! Build these words. Pause the video.

27
00:02:49.933 --> 00:02:51.280
Just add the parts.

28
00:02:53.267 --> 00:02:54.521
Drop the e.

29
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.800
Double the m.

30
00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.379
How many did you get right?

31
00:03:06.867 --> 00:03:09.143
Break it into parts. Then check the rules.
